"<qt>"
"<p>This is a sensor display. To customize a sensor display click and hold "
"the right mouse button on either the frame or the display box and select the "
"<i>Properties</i> entry from the popup menu. Select <i>Remove</i> to delete "
"the display from the worksheet.</p>%1</qt>"
